<description>&lt;p&gt;Grenade blasts wounded security volunteers in Narathiwar and Yala and a pipe bomb injured army officers in the same insurgency zone, showing continued violence in southern Thailand. Thailand rejected Cambodia's claims over two temples and artefacts and protested Cambodia's road construction in Oddar Meanchey, while Cambodia persisted in its protests over the construction and temple disputes. Thailand is introducing digital border passes at the Mae Sai crossing and has joined Singapore and Malaysia in the BLOOM cross-border digital money settlement initiative, and the first phase of a border fence in Chanthaburi has been completed. Malaysia and Thailand began joint maritime patrols to curb crime and held joint meetings to promote bilateral cooperation in border areas. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOeWJvSXp5bFJOc1VESzNvQU9UblFKS3U5ZWYwdGIzdW5fWjg2ZnlwNnduYV9rV1J5eV9mM0JuTXpVei1jVXNSWjFuZE1BQ0FhRy1wbm1RcU1hMDd0aUp6T19iaUJwTGF2Nld3NGhvQnkteThOdDRVS3JsUVlROUVkQWhPZWFaSm0zZW5mTlRlYTREWFlUY21vTzI0QU1Sb1gtVGk2RGw1Y3FYclZXYUhqaUN4TW0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Diplomat – Asia-Pacific Current Affairs Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQM0Q5aERJNXlZNC1lLXJrNlRNSHZFc24yRVAwTmJOWDNhVjJJMGczV29KUC1yeWFmc1VSU2dzMnFoYmZSaVU1YmJEM2hGckRzaU9fQlNMQWFZbUp2Rmxrdk5ETm9zUURzaWxyaVdlXy1zSGV2NnlsdHBudTZLeVdPZHJnNS12Y001YWVOWUMwNHBTczkzQTcxU1FhWmN5dldZTUFjdFZadnRnbk9RTHVCUUZmQ3FRUHFHeWNSbmtBNEc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNd1RxWVkxa3NEZE9weWhHQ3FsdEZZVTNCM3ZDcjNkVTVVNnkwaWQ0cTg4My1OWXlJTTZ6d3lGZ0VRMFVWSnNmbk1PY1dIRXJqR1pMc0lyOEVBX3lyN1ktbWdJY2FNOUFwQXNDQmlEZ2tjYlRvUkdxUXpZZFNUYW03QnRYNU11aFBKaGhYaGxsVj